# Era 1, The Exchange (year 0, harvest to the first frost): places, people, households and fates. Story lead,
# package W2-F, 2026-10-22. DRAFT: written under the blanket approval; every spoken line waits for the author's
# approval (ledger row S14). Design: design/eras/era1.md (commit 0008ccc), decisions in commit e519930.
# Era 1 plays in the same act as era 2, before it: var.era is 1 while it plays and 2 from the witness on, so
# the props show their era 1 states. Every era 1 node costs 0 minutes, so era 2's clock starts where it always
# did (05:50). Era 1 writes no record event, so the community model reaches era 2 as it always did.
# Plates: the q1_* places have no plates yet (package W3-C); the scenes that happen in a place era 2 already
# paints (the tower, the post, the hill road, the Haldane kitchen, the Sheaf) use it.

@var era
default: 2

